                        "form": "taskmasters"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f811541e-a620-38d5-b032-3c553447d67c",
                        "entry_id": "a68743b5-d381-3355-bb5e-48fb6c7a9b61",
                        "glosses": [
                            "工頭，監工"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5c603353-685f-4866-a3d0-581361b6aecb",
                                "sense_id": "f811541e-a620-38d5-b032-3c553447d67c",
                                "text": "耶和華說，我的百姓在埃及所受的困苦，我實在看見了；他們因受督工的轄制所發的哀聲，我也聽見了，我原知道他們的痛苦。"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6eab47b8-dffe-3673-ae50-954807914cc7",
                        "entry_id": "a68743b5-d381-3355-bb5e-48fb6c7a9b61",
                        "glosses": [
                            "努力工作或責任的來源"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bbd145b9-8670-47c9-a559-9a02a9021099",
                                "sense_id": "6eab47b8-dffe-3673-ae50-954807914cc7",
                                "text": "It all looked so easy when the competent were at the helm, but reality is a cruel taskmaster, and all the excuses that worked as an underling wear thin once the incompetent are in leadership roles.",
                                "translation": "当有能力的人掌舵时，这一切看起来很容易，但现实是一个残酷的工头，一旦无能者担任领导角色，所有作为下属工作的借口都会变得无用。"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
